    <fields>
        <fullName>FAM__Fixed_Asset_GLA__c</fullName>
        <deleteConstraint>SetNull</deleteConstraint>
        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <description>The fixed asset general ledger account that relates to this asset sub-group. This field enables you to automatically populate the corresponding Fixed Asset GLA field while creating a new asset in this asset sub-group. This general ledger account is debited when the asset is acquired and credited when the asset is disposed of. This is normally a balance sheet account.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>The fixed asset general ledger account that relates to this asset sub-group. This field enables you to automatically populate the corresponding Fixed Asset GLA field while creating a new asset in this asset sub-group. This general ledger account is debited when the asset is acquired and credited when the asset is disposed of. This is normally a balance sheet account.</inlineHelpText>
